{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01P7VWFuUqbhUJb8uNegwiVm","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Spec: Dark-Mode Toggle\n2\t\n3\tStatus: ready-for-agent\n4\t\n5\t## Summary\n6\tAdd a theme control to the Settings page that lets users choose Light, Dark, or System appearance.\n7\t\n8\t## Requirements\n9\t- **Options:** `system` (default), `light`, `dark`.\n10\t- **Default:** New and existing users start on `system`, which follows the OS `prefers-color-scheme` setting.\n11\t- **Persistence:** Store the choice per user in their profile (e.g. `profile.theme_preference`) so it follows them across devices and sessions.\n12\t- **Live updates:** Changing the setting applies the theme right away, with no page reload. In `system` mode, the app reacts when the OS preference changes.\n13\t- **No flash:** Apply the resolved theme before first paint, using a cached value until the profile loads.\n14\t\n15\t## Implementation Notes\n16\t- Add a nullable `theme_preference` field to the user profile, where null means `system`.\n17\t- Expose it through the existing profile read/update API.\n18\t- Drive styling with a `data-theme` attribute on `<html>` and CSS variables.\n19\t\n20\t## Acceptance Criteria\n21\t- The toggle shows the saved value when the Settings page loads.\n22\t- The selection survives logout/login and works on other devices.\n23\t- In `system` mode, the theme follows the OS setting.\n24\t- Both themes meet WCAG AA contrast.\n25\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbb0","uuid":"fb2cb540-3ead-4281-be29-0cc717073658","timestamp":"2026-10-01T02:14:00.844Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"«WORKING_AREA»/spec.md","content":"# Spec: Dark-Mode Toggle\n\nStatus: ready-for-agent\n\n## Summary\nAdd a theme control to the Settings page that lets users choose Light, Dark, or System appearance.\n\n## Requirements\n- **Options:** `system` (default), `light`, `dark`.\n- **Default:** New and existing users start on `system`, which follows the OS `prefers-color-scheme` setting.\n- **Persistence:** Store the choice per user in their profile (e.g. `profile.theme_preference`) so it follows them across devices and sessions.\n- **Live updates:** Changing the setting applies the theme right away, with no page reload. In `system` mode, the app reacts when the OS preference changes.\n- **No flash:** Apply the resolved theme before first paint, using a cached value until the profile loads.\n\n## Implementation Notes\n- Add a nullable `theme_preference` field to the user profile, where null means `system`.\n- Expose it through the existing profile read/update API.\n- Drive styling with a `data-theme` attribute on `<html>` and CSS variables.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- The toggle shows the saved value when the Settings page loads.\n- The selection survives logout/login and works on other devices.\n- In `system` mode, the theme follows the OS setting.\n- Both themes meet WCAG AA contrast.\n","numLines":25,"startLine":1,"totalLines":25}}}
