{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfai6sUGMAzNFVpxsR5eS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. **Theme preference end to end.** Blocked by: nothing. Adds a nullable `theme_preference` field to the profile and exposes it through the profile API. Builds the Settings toggle (System/Light/Dark) and applies `data-theme` live with no reload. The saved value persists across devices.\n\n2. **System mode and no-flash first paint.** Blocked by: #1. In `system` mode the theme follows changes to the OS `prefers-color-scheme`. A cached value applies the theme before first paint, and both themes meet WCAG AA contrast."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4702,"cache_read_input_tokens":15027,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4702},"output_tokens":185,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbb0","uuid":"a23626e0-0a2e-41f8-b328-ffa4f530b666","timestamp":"2026-10-01T02:14:05.243Z","request_id":"req_011Cfai6s4hrDHXHT7BeYHw9"}
